contentText:
Axl Rose didn&#8217;t go &#8220;numb when he learned to see&#8221; recently, as Guns N&#8217; Roses &#8216; &#8220;Civil War&#8221; lyrics say, but instead, he went numb thanks to his battle with TMJ, the rocker revealed during the band&#8217;s sprawling three-hour show at New Jersey&#8217;s MetLife Stadium on Wednesday (Aug. 12).

